### Case: armored-body — the wire format everybody gets wrong first.
### A RAW armored message, exactly as every PGP tool emits it.
### Expect 400. The gateway wants base64 OF the armor, not the armor.
### This is the single most likely integration failure with a counterparty.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/statements/inbound
content-type: text/plain

-----BEGIN PGP MESSAGE-----

hQEMA0000000000000
-----END PGP MESSAGE-----
